ht i think many people  would i think firstly the prime minister  is battling for britain is going out to  secure the best deal and whether there  is a deal is not simply down  to the actions of the prime minister it  needs the eu  to move to respond to the precedent that  they've given  to other countries and i'm sure what you  would really respect that hey stephen  barkley love you this morning thanks  very much for being with us

